2. horn C -- conformal coupling g~ = e^{2 phi} g: the null cone of g~ IS the null cone of g, so photons see the Einstein-frame potentials only
====================================================================================================
  [PASS] 2a the photon dispersion relation g~^{mu nu} k_mu k_nu = 0 is e^{-2 phi} x (g^{mu nu} k_mu k_nu) = 0: the conformal factor drops out, the light cone is g's, and light bends by U (the baryons) only
    READING: dynamics feel Phi_E + phi (the MOND amplitude), lensing feels Phi_E (the baryons): the slip-lock of DC-013 / the L241 lensing kill (galaxy-galaxy lensing carries the MOND amplitude).

